        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "Recoveries are calculated from the increase in peak areas between the non-spiked and spiked chromatograms using the deuterated internal standard method. The extraction recoveries were satisfactory, since they ranged from 65.0 to 91.8%. The relative standard deviations (RSDs, %) varied from 0.59 to 7.0% for the PAHs, the high value in RSD, could be explained due to the multi-step process such as spiking, extraction and evaporation.",
